  m_Name: Blade16
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  partName: Blade
  description: The Blade is a tiny, thin-flat blade located at the middle-center
    of the jet engine, made of Blades material, playing a crucial role in compressing
    air and increasing its temperature and pressure, with an interesting detail being
    its ability to withstand extremely high rotational speeds. Its small size and
    specific shape allow for efficient airflow and minimal energy loss. As part of
    the engine's compressor stage, Blade is essential for the overall performance
    and efficiency of the jet engine.
